<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Shelter (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864857545"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:56.274"><div begin="19.782" end="3:56.274"><p begin="19.782" end="23.617" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.782" end="20.069">I</span> <span begin="20.069" end="20.394">could</span> <span begin="20.394" end="20.677">ne</span><span begin="20.677" end="20.983">ver</span> <span begin="20.983" end="21.297">find</span> <span begin="21.297" end="21.568">the</span> <span begin="21.568" end="22.037">right</span> <span begin="22.037" end="22.465">way</span> <span begin="22.465" end="22.747">to</span> <span begin="22.747" end="23.242">tell</span> <span begin="23.242" end="23.617">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我找不到合理的方法告诉你</span></p><p begin="24.545" end="26.932" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.545" end="24.861">Have</span> <span begin="24.861" end="25.072">you</span> <span begin="25.072" end="25.375">no</span><span begin="25.375" end="25.659">ticed</span> <span begin="25.659" end="25.932">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="25.932" end="26.242">been</span> <span begin="26.242" end="26.932">gone?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是否察觉 我的身影已经遥远</span></p><p begin="29.377" end="33.550" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.377" end="29.554">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="29.554" end="29.810">I</span> <span begin="29.810" end="30.277">left</span> <span begin="30.277" end="30.547">be</span><span begin="30.547" end="30.872">hind</span> <span begin="30.872" end="31.220">the</span> <span begin="31.220" end="31.679">home</span> <span begin="31.679" end="32.052">that</span> <span begin="32.052" end="32.360">you</span> <span begin="32.360" end="32.823">made</span> <span begin="32.823" end="33.550">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我已渐行渐远 你所构建的港湾</span></p><p begin="34.036" end="36.481" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.036" end="34.188">But</span> <span begin="34.188" end="34.345">I</span> <span begin="34.345" end="34.629">will</span> <span begin="34.629" end="35.103">car</span><span begin="35.103" end="35.257">ry</span> <span begin="35.257" end="35.636">it</span> <span begin="35.636" end="35.838">a</span><span begin="35.838" end="36.481">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我仍会将它怀揣心中</span></p><p begin="38.988" end="43.114" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.988" end="39.121">When</span> <span begin="39.121" end="39.432">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="39.432" end="39.873">ol</span><span begin="39.873" end="40.198">der,</span> <span begin="40.198" end="40.490">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="40.490" end="40.781">be</span> <span begin="40.781" end="41.216">si</span><span begin="41.216" end="41.660">lent</span> <span begin="41.660" end="41.958">be</span><span begin="41.958" end="42.368">side</span> <span begin="42.368" end="43.114">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">年纪增大 在你身边 我逐渐变得沉默</span></p><p begin="43.784" end="45.952" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.784" end="43.941">I</span> <span begin="43.941" end="44.219">know</span> <span begin="44.219" end="44.710">words</span> <span begin="44.710" end="44.985">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="44.985" end="45.290">be</span> <span begin="45.290" end="45.423">e</span><span begin="45.423" end="45.952">nough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我深知 再多话语 也不足够</span></p><p begin="48.448" end="52.962" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.448" end="48.585">And</span> <span begin="48.585" end="48.695">they</span> <span begin="48.695" end="49.010">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="49.010" end="49.443">need</span> <span begin="49.443" end="49.730">to</span> <span begin="49.730" end="50.033">know</span> <span begin="50.033" end="50.363">the</span> <span begin="50.363" end="50.825">names</span> <span begin="50.825" end="51.270">or</span> <span begin="51.270" end="51.568">our</span> <span begin="51.568" end="52.009">fa</span><span begin="52.009" end="52.962">ces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他们无需知道 我们的名字或模样</span></p><p begin="53.217" end="55.835" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.217" end="53.365">But</span> <span begin="53.365" end="53.520">they</span> <span begin="53.520" end="53.820">will</span> <span begin="53.820" end="54.277">car</span><span begin="54.277" end="54.452">ry</span> <span begin="54.452" end="54.867">on</span> <span begin="54.867" end="55.032">for</span> <span begin="55.032" end="55.835">us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但他们也会一起 坚守下去</span></p><p begin="56.727" end="1:01.476" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.727" end="57.005">And</span> <span begin="57.005" end="57.299">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="57.299" end="57.588">a</span> <span begin="57.588" end="58.027">long</span> <span begin="58.027" end="58.477">way</span> <span begin="58.477" end="59.087">for</span><span begin="59.087" end="59.464">ward,</span> <span begin="59.742" end="59.964">so</span> <span begin="59.964" end="1:00.429">trust</span> <span begin="1:00.429" end="1:00.821">in</span> <span begin="1:00.821" end="1:01.476">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">纵使长路漫漫 希望你相信我</span></p><p begin="1:02.066" end="1:06.036" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.066" end="1:02.324">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:02.324" end="1:02.844">give</span> <span begin="1:02.844" end="1:03.256">them</span> <span begin="1:03.256" end="1:03.876">shel</span><span begin="1:03.876" end="1:04.191">ter,</span> <span begin="1:04.191" end="1:04.469">like</span> <span begin="1:04.469" end="1:04.759">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:04.759" end="1:05.206">done</span> <span begin="1:05.206" end="1:05.629">for</span> <span begin="1:05.629" end="1:06.036">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我定尽力将他们庇护 正如你为我那样</span></p><p begin="1:06.294" end="1:12.423" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.294" end="1:06.586">And</span> <span begin="1:06.586" end="1:06.874">I</span> <span begin="1:06.874" end="1:07.391">know</span> <span begin="1:07.774" end="1:08.071">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:08.071" end="1:08.989">not</span> <span begin="1:08.989" end="1:09.271">a</span><span begin="1:09.271" end="1:09.896">lone,</span> <span begin="1:10.176" end="1:10.476">you&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:10.476" end="1:10.631">be</span> <span begin="1:10.631" end="1:11.059">wat</span><span begin="1:11.059" end="1:11.218">ching</span> <span begin="1:11.218" end="1:11.668">o</span><span begin="1:11.668" end="1:11.844">ver</span> <span begin="1:11.844" end="1:12.423">us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我心知肚明 我并非一人 你总默默守护我们</span></p><p begin="1:12.586" end="1:14.969" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.586" end="1:12.894">Un</span><span begin="1:12.894" end="1:13.538">til</span> <span begin="1:13.784" end="1:14.243">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:14.243" end="1:14.969">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">直到你真正离去</span></p><p begin="2:22.178" end="2:25.987" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.178" end="2:22.483">I</span> <span begin="2:22.483" end="2:22.770">could</span> <span begin="2:22.770" end="2:23.095">ne</span><span begin="2:23.095" end="2:23.372">ver</span> <span begin="2:23.372" end="2:23.670">find</span> <span begin="2:23.670" end="2:23.965">the</span> <span begin="2:23.965